    "Only two ordered boots per architecture on an active host; no confidence interval or statistical significance claim. Ratios describe this workload and these guest/backend combinations only.",
    "ARM Whonix 18.2.2.7-developers-only / Debian 13.7 / Linux 6.12.107 differs from x86 Whonix 18.2.1.9 / Debian 13.6 / Linux 6.12.95. Matching Tor Browser and Firefox build IDs does not remove guest library, kernel, profile or graphics-device differences.",
